  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital CEA support for Ukraine regional emergency response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eastern Europe: e.g. Poland, Hungary, Slovakia, Romania as needed.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Embedding digital community engagement in humanitarian services of national societies to use digital communication to improve the way they interact with volunteers, staff and people affected. Through this, improve the user experience and access to services for people affected, allowing them to also engage with humanitarian organizations through digital channels.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensure that the diverse needs, priorities and preferences of the affected communities guide the response ensuring a people-centred approach and meaningful community participation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">People affected by the war in Ukraine</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social media monitoring
Feedback system for Cash and Voucher Assistance
Helpful Information App or any other digital product that may be needed, resulting from bi-weekly update meetings</narrative>
  </description>
